#b#cff0099ff* How to join#nb#nc
 - Every day at 14:30 and 21:30 (Philippine time, GMT+8).
 - Registration opens 5 minutes before: Donaris > FFA Arena > Register.
 - Entry fee: 10,000,000 Penya (refunded if the FFA is cancelled). Level 60 or higher.
 - Changed your mind? While registration is open, press Cancel in the FFA Arena window: you get the fee back minus 20%.
 - When the arena opens, press Join within 1 minute to go to the waiting area.
 - Fewer than 2 players inside = the FFA is cancelled and every fee is refunded.
#b#cff0099ff* Battle#nb#nc
 - The battle lasts 10 minutes. Everyone else is your enemy (shown as "Enemy").
 - Your party is dissolved, and you get the arena buffs when you enter.
 - Every player has 10 lives. When you die you are revived in the waiting area, and you go back into the arena 10 seconds later.
 - No lives left: you watch from the waiting area until the end.
 - No EXP loss and no PK penalty in the arena.
 - The battle ends early when fewer than 2 players have lives left.
#b#cff0099ff* Staying away#nb#nc
 - Offline or outside the arena while the battle runs, you lose 1 life every minute.
#b#cff0099ff* Rewards (PVP Tokens)#nb#nc
 - 1 PVP Token for every kill, paid at once.
 - Most kills: 1st +30, 2nd +20, 3rd +10 tokens (at least 1 kill needed).
 - Spend your tokens at Donaris or Amos.
